# Tenants module: sample requests (VS Code REST Client / Visual Studio / Rider).
# 1) Run "Register" or "Login", copy accessToken into @token. 2) "Create business", copy its slug into @tenant.
# Admin requests need a platform admin token:
#   UPDATE identity.users SET is_platform_admin = true WHERE email = '...';  then log in again.

@api = http://localhost:5240/api/v1
@token = paste-access-token
@tenant = fit-with-ahmed

### Register
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "owner@example.com", "password": "Secret123!", "fullName": "Ahmed Coach", "locale": "ar" }

### Login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "owner@example.com", "password": "Secret123!" }

### Is the slug free? (anonymous) → { slug, available, reason }
GET {{api}}/tenants/slug-availability?slug={{tenant}}

### Create business → 201, trial starts, you are the owner
POST {{api}}/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Fit With Ahmed", "slug": "{{tenant}}", "defaultCurrency": "EGP", "timezone": "Africa/Cairo", "defaultLocale": "ar" }

### My businesses (role + permissions per business)
GET {{api}}/me/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Current business (X-Tenant chooses it)
GET {{api}}/tenant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Tenant: {{tenant}}

### Update business (owner): fields left out are unchanged
PATCH {{api}}/tenant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Tenant: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ahmed Coaching",
  "branding": { "logoUrl": "https://cdn.example.com/logo.png", "primaryColor": "#0f766e", "tagline": "Get strong" },
  "settings": { "contactEmail": "hello@example.com", "whatsApp": "+201000000000" }
}

### Plan, subscription and usage
GET {{api}}/tenant/plan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Tenant: {{tenant}}

### Public profile (anonymous)
GET {{api}}/public/{{tenant}}

### SaaS price list (anonymous)
GET {{api}}/plans

### Payout accounts (owner)
GET {{api}}/tenant/payment-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Tenant: {{tenant}}

### Connect a payout account → 201 (first one becomes the default)
POST {{api}}/tenant/payment-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Tenant: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "provider": "paymob", "providerAccountId": "merchant-123" }

### Errors to try: no X-Tenant → 400 tenant_required; unknown slug → 404 tenant_not_found
GET {{api}}/tenant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---- Platform admin ----

### All plans (including inactive)
GET {{api}}/admin/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a plan
POST {{api}}/admin/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "gym",
  "name": "Gym",
  "monthlyPrice": { "amount": 249.00, "currency": "USD" },
  "maxClients": null,
  "maxCoaches": 25,
  "features": { "nutrition": true, "training": true, "chat": true, "custom_branding": true, "custom_domain": true }
}

### Businesses, newest first (status: trial | active | past_due | suspended | cancelled)
GET {{api}}/admin/tenants?status=trial&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
